    title: "verilog: an instantiation with zero or one port, a positional port, .* or an instance array emits no instantiates edge (the grammar calls it checker_instantiation or udp_instantiation)"  # 6d03
    status: todo_hard  # 6d03
    priority: 3  # 6d03
    parent:  # 6d03
