  message: "Fixed in PR #2198. Re-ran the item's d.v: instantiations with zero or one port, positional ports, .* and instance arrays emit instantiates edges (fixture 3 -> 7); a name declared only as a checker, program or primitive emits none; an undeclared module gets the external edge the two-port form already had. NOT measured on real code (no Verilog repository cloned). bind was not checked."  # b785
